{"step_index":142,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:08:45Z","content":"I have built and verified **UMGN**, a secure, production-ready personal AI chatbot web application.\n\n### Highlights\n\n1. **ChatGPT-Style Responsive Interface**:\n   - Collapsible desktop sidebar and mobile drawer for phone/laptop responsiveness.\n   - Chronological chat history (*Today*, *Yesterday*, *Previous 7 Days*, *Older*) with inline chat renaming and deletion.\n   - Markdown rendering with code blocks, language badges, and one-click \"Copy Code\".\n   - Real-time streaming response simulation with typing cursor and \"Stop generating\" control.\n   - Suggestion starter cards and auto-resizing textarea.\n\n2. **Security & Privacy by Design**:\n   - **Zero Client-Side Secret Exposure**: LLM API keys (`GEMINI_API_KEY`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`) are managed strictly server-side in `.env.local`.\n   - **Built-in Fallback Assistant**: If no external API key is provided, UMGN runs an intelligent internal streaming assistant engine out-of-the-box.\n   - **Data Minimization**: Stores only username, email, and 12-round salted `bcrypt` password hashes. No tracking pixels or telemetry.\n   - **HttpOnly Cookies**: Session tokens utilize stateless `jose` JWTs in `HttpOnly`, `SameSite=Strict`, `Secure` cookies.\n   - **Rate Limiting & Security Headers**: Built-in sliding-window rate limiters, HSTS, CSP, and `X-Frame-Options: DENY`.\n\n3. **User Data Rights (GDPR Compliant)**:\n   - **Data Export**: Full JSON export of user profile, settings, chats, and messages via *Settings > Data Controls*.\n   - **Clear History**: One-click purge of all conversation history.\n   - **Permanent Account Deletion**: Hard-deletes account, credentials, and cascades all database records.\n\n4. **Database & Cloud Scalability**:\n   - Built on **Prisma ORM** with SQLite by default (`prisma/umgn.db`) for personal/team use (10–50 users).\n   - Seamlessly scales to cloud PostgreSQL (AWS RDS, Supabase, Neon) by updating `provider = \"postgresql\"` in [`schema.prisma`](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/ud/prisma/schema.prisma).\n   - Includes production [`Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/ud/Dockerfile), [`docker-compose.yml`](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/ud/docker-compose.yml), and [`Caddyfile`](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/ud/Caddyfile) for automated Let's Encrypt HTTPS/SSL.\n\n5. **Verification**:\n   - All 7 automated end-to-end integration tests passed (Registration, Session Verification, Chat Creation, Streaming, Data Export, Clear Chats, and Account Deletion).\n   - Production bundle built cleanly with zero compilation errors.\n\nFor complete details and commands, see the [walkthrough artifact](file:///C:/Users/LENOVO/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbddb07a-087d-40c2-b774-094d2b1c9cef/walkthrough.md) and the [production deployment guide](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/ud/DEPLOYMENT.md). To start the app locally, run `npm run dev` and open `http://localhost:3000`."}
